 "10227": {
  "en": [
   "We are all drunk on the lure of the far sky, forgetful of home —",
   "like honeybees restless with the scent of the bakul grove.",
   "Before the sun rises, our minds awaken —",
   "from the wind we catch so many tunes of daybreak.",
   "Who beckons us there",
   "from cloud to cloud of the blue hills — I think I know the hint.",
   "The path goes winding on, calling and calling toward the unseen,",
   "intent on the restless search for what can never be caught."
  ],
