 "10228": {
  "en": [
   "I have come out from my own inner self,",
   "I will set sail into the blue sky on the stream of the mad wind.",
   "When the mango blossoms, opening and opening, fall dropping and dropping",
   "filling and filling the lap of the earth —",
   "I shed my heart's words in the brimming Phalgun and Chaitra.",
   "Where do you wander, roaming and roaming, companion of my life —",
   "playing hide-and-seek in the light and shade of the forest path.",
   "My lonely flute sends its madness to the horizon",
   "for the sake of your song —",
   "when shall I waken the spring in me and in you."
  ],
