 "10229": {
  "en": [
   "I hear that tinkling, the sound of anklets at every step,",
   "on the startled path, from wood to wood.",
   "A waterfall pours streaming, streaming in the distance,",
   "under the water the stones ring, tinkle-tinkle, tinkle-tinkle.",
   "The cricket-thrumming shade of the bamboo grove trembles with the murmur of leaves,",
   "the papiya calls, and on the thrilled shirish branch",
   "the south wind comes swinging it again and again."
