 "10230": {
  "en": [
   "See, the basket of flowers is filled, flower upon flower.",
   "It is filled — who will take it, who will take it, to weave the welcoming garland?",
   "Champa, chameli, seuti, beli —",
   "come see the tray I have spread out today —",
   "poured over with new-malati scent.",
   "Steal the forest's sweetness into your own young body.",
   "New bride, on the blessed night of union take it into the bridal chamber —",
   "the fragrant speech of the garden,",
   "the hope of the nectar-thirsty bee.",
   "The night-waking tuberose —",
   "the karabi, the beauty's alakananda —",
   "rose joining with rose, they will compose the play of union."
  ],
