 "10231": {
  "en": [
   "Who has entangled my mind in the net of melody?",
   "I cannot free myself from that bond.",
   "The one who draws me away into unknown depths",
   "has drowned me in dream-shadows of many colors.",
   "I do not know where I set my feet; my eyes open on a mirage —",
   "With what spell the distant flute has beguiled me! My listless mind",
   "has lost itself, consciousness veiled in sound."
  ],
