 "10232": {
  "en": [
   "Nowhere am I forbidden to lose myself, in my mind!",
   "I have spread these wings of song's melody, in my mind.",
   "I cross the fairy-tale expanse of the endless field,",
   "losing my way to the far shore of that hushed tale —",
   "I come to know the champa of the parul grove, in my mind.",
   "When the sun droops toward setting, I gather sky-flowers from cloud to cloud.",
   "Merging with the foam upon foam of the seven seas",
   "I go floating toward far horizons —",
   "I storm the closed doors of the fairies' land, in my mind."
  ],
